== Description ==

'''Iron Ore''' is a mineable ore in ''[[Human Host]]'', obtained by [[Mining|mining]] terrain deposits. It appears as an ingredient in 19 downstream recipes at the [[Cutting Workbench]] and the [[Furnace]], including [[Pig Iron]], [[Forged Iron]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

